<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" ><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.3.2">Jekyll</generator><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml" /><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" /><updated>2026-08-31T23:14:12-07:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/feed.xml</id><title type="html">Hermosawave Photography</title><subtitle>A series of daily landscape photographs by Daniel Sofer, 20 years running.</subtitle><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><entry><title type="html">Tower Sunset</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260831/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Tower Sunset" /><published>2026-08-31T00:00:00-07:00</published><updated>2026-08-31T00:00:00-07:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/lifeguard-sunset</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260831/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
    Lots of clouds in the sky for tonight's sunset by the 2nd St. Lifeguard Tower.
</p>
<p class="jp">
<span class="title_jp">タワーの夕日</span>
今夜は2nd St.のライフガードタワー付近、夕日の空に雲がたくさん
</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Hermosa Beach" /><category term="Dusk" /><category term="Beach" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Lots of clouds in the sky for tonight's sunset by the 2nd St. Lifeguard Tower. タワーの夕日 今夜は2nd St.のライフガードタワー付近、夕日の空に雲がたくさん]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2608_A7R04992.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2608_A7R04992.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Evening Clouds</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260830/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Evening Clouds" /><published>2026-08-30T00:00:00-07:00</published><updated>2026-08-30T00:00:00-07:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/evening-clouds</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260830/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
A string of clouds lit up just after sunset, at 2nd St. in Hermosa Beach, California.
</p>
<p class="jp">
<span class="title_jp">夕方の雲</span>
日没直後、カリフォルニア州ハモサビーチで、一列に連なる雲が夕焼けに照らされていた。
</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Hermosa Beach" /><category term="Dusk" /><category term="Beach" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[A string of clouds lit up just after sunset, at 2nd St. in Hermosa Beach, California. 夕方の雲 日没直後、カリフォルニア州ハモサビーチで、一列に連なる雲が夕焼けに照らされていた。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2608_A7R05005.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2608_A7R05005.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Hermosa Pier</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260829/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Hermosa Pier" /><published>2026-08-29T00:00:00-07:00</published><updated>2026-08-29T00:00:00-07:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/hermosa-pier</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260829/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
Standing alongside the Hermosa Beach Pier, camera very low to get the best reflection off the sand. A swimmer enjoys the sunset, too.
</p>
<p class="jp">
<span class="title_jp">ハモサ・ピア</span>
ハモサ・ビーチ・ピアのそばに立ち、砂に映る反射を最も美しく捉えるため、カメラを非常に低い位置に構えた。泳いでいる人も夕日を満喫している。
</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Hermosa Beach" /><category term="Sunset" /><category term="Beach" /><category term="Hermosa Pier" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Standing alongside the Hermosa Beach Pier, camera very low to get the best reflection off the sand. A swimmer enjoys the sunset, too. ハモサ・ピア ハモサ・ビーチ・ピアのそばに立ち、砂に映る反射を最も美しく捉えるため、カメラを非常に低い位置に構えた。泳いでいる人も夕日を満喫している。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2608_A7R04928.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2608_A7R04928.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">The Kettle</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260828/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="The Kettle" /><published>2026-08-28T00:00:00-07:00</published><updated>2026-08-28T00:00:00-07:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/the-kettle</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260828/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
Neon Sign and mural for The Kettle, a casual restaurant in Manhattan Beach. Mural by Wylie West.
</p>
<p class="jp">
<span class="title_jp">「ザ・ケトル」</span>
マンハッタンビーチにあるカジュアルレストラン「ザ・ケトル」のネオンサインと壁画。壁画はワイリー・ウェストによる。
</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Manhattan Beach" /><category term="Art" /><category term="Dusk" /><category term="Architecture" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Neon Sign and mural for The Kettle, a casual restaurant in Manhattan Beach. Mural by Wylie West. 「ザ・ケトル」 マンハッタンビーチにあるカジュアルレストラン「ザ・ケトル」のネオンサインと壁画。壁画はワイリー・ウェストによる。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2608_A7R03894.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2608_A7R03894.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Lunar Eclipse</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260827/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Lunar Eclipse" /><published>2026-08-27T00:00:00-07:00</published><updated>2026-08-27T00:00:00-07:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/eclipse</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260827/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
The almost complete lunar eclipse in Southern California. With the moon so dim, I can turn up the brightness to show more of the sky,  stars, planes and clouds.
</p>
<p class="jp">
<span class="title_jp">月食</span>
南カリフォルニアで見られた、ほぼ完全な月食だ。月がかなり暗いため、明るさを上げて、空や星、飛行機、雲をもっとよく見えるようにした。
</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Torrance" /><category term="Moon" /><category term="Eclipse" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[The almost complete lunar eclipse in Southern California. With the moon so dim, I can turn up the brightness to show more of the sky, stars, planes and clouds. 月食 南カリフォルニアで見られた、ほぼ完全な月食だ。月がかなり暗いため、明るさを上げて、空や星、飛行機、雲をもっとよく見えるようにした。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2608_A7R04551_edit.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2608_A7R04551_edit.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Golden Manhattan Beach</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260825/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Golden Manhattan Beach" /><published>2026-08-25T00:00:00-07:00</published><updated>2026-08-25T00:00:00-07:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/golden-mb</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260825/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
Looking north from the Manhattan Beach Pier, at the beach bathed in golden afternoon sunlight.
</p>
<p class="jp">
<span class="title_jp">ゴールデン・マンハッタン・ビーチ</span>
マンハッタン・ビーチ・ピアから北を望むと、午後の黄金色の日差しに包まれたビーチが見える。
</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Manhattan Beach" /><category term="Golden Hour" /><category term="Beach" /><category term="Lifeguard Towers" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Looking north from the Manhattan Beach Pier, at the beach bathed in golden afternoon sunlight. ゴールデン・マンハッタン・ビーチ マンハッタン・ビーチ・ピアから北を望むと、午後の黄金色の日差しに包まれたビーチが見える。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2608_A7R03742.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2608_A7R03742.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Manhattan Beach</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260824/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Manhattan Beach" /><published>2026-08-24T00:00:00-07:00</published><updated>2026-08-24T00:00:00-07:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/mb-pier</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260824/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
Waiting for a wave at sunset. A beautiful scene from the Manhattan Beach Pier.
</p>
<p class="jp">
<span class="title_jp">マンハッタンビーチ</span>
夕暮れ時、波待ち。マンハッタンビーチ・ピアからの美しい光景だ。
</p>

