Sunset over Culver City and the Santa Monica Mountains. A stripe of fog runs down the tall buildings of Wilshire Blvd., I don't know if I've ever seen that before.
</p>
<p class="jp">
<span class="title_jp">ウェストサイドの夕日</span>
カルバーシティとサンタモニカ山脈に沈む夕日だ。ウィルシャー大通りの高層ビル群に沿って、霧の帯が伸びている。
</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Southern California" /><category term="Sunset" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Sunset over Culver City and the Santa Monica Mountains. A stripe of fog runs down the tall buildings of Wilshire Blvd., I don't know if I've ever seen that before. ウェストサイドの夕日 カルバーシティとサンタモニカ山脈に沈む夕日だ。ウィルシャー大通りの高層ビル群に沿って、霧の帯が伸びている。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2608_A7R03717-HDR.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2608_A7R03717-HDR.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Sashimi Kanpachi</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260822/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Sashimi Kanpachi" /><published>2026-08-22T00:00:00-07:00</published><updated>2026-08-22T00:00:00-07:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/hayama</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260822/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
Close up on plate of sashimi at Restaurant <a href="https://www.hayamaxwatami.com" target="_blank" > Hayama</a>, in the Helms Bakery complex. Umm.
</p>
<p class="jp">
<span class="title_jp">カンパチ</span>
ヘルムズ・ベーカリーの複合施設内にある「<a href="https://www.hayamaxwatami.com" target="_blank">Hayama by WATAMI</a>」の刺身盛り合わせのクローズアップ写真だ。うーん。</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Southern California" /><category term="Food" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Close up on plate of sashimi at Restaurant Hayama, in the Helms Bakery complex. Umm. カンパチ ヘルムズ・ベーカリーの複合施設内にある「Hayama by WATAMI」の刺身盛り合わせのクローズアップ写真だ。うーん。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2608_A7R03574.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2608_A7R03574.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Redondo Pier Sunset</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260821/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Redondo Pier Sunset" /><published>2026-08-21T00:00:00-07:00</published><updated>2026-08-21T00:00:00-07:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/redondo</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260821/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
Sun sets into the Pacific Ocean, flanked by a pair of sail-shaped trellises at the Redondo Beach Pier.
</p>
<p class="jp">
<span class="title_jp">レドンド・ピアの夕日</span>
レドンド・ビーチ・ピアでは、帆の形をした一対のトレリスに挟まれて、太陽が太平洋に沈んでいく。</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Redondo Beach" /><category term="Piers" /><category term="Sunset" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Sun sets into the Pacific Ocean, flanked by a pair of sail-shaped trellises at the Redondo Beach Pier. レドンド・ピアの夕日 レドンド・ビーチ・ピアでは、帆の形をした一対のトレリスに挟まれて、太陽が太平洋に沈んでいく。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2608_A7R03633-HDR.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2608_A7R03633-HDR.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry></feed>